================================================================================
SECURITY
================================================================================

Security is cross-cutting.

It is NOT postponed until the end.


Apply throughout implementation:


    Least Privilege
    Authentication
    Authorization
    Secure defaults
    Firewalling
    Password policies
    Account lockout
    IAM policies
    Secrets management
    Audit logs
    Patch management
    Backups
    Access reviews


Advanced security infrastructure remains optional
until justified by the architecture.


